**Definition of success:** An investigator can start with a shipment, open its actual custody events, inspect origin and destination conditions, link photographs and incidents to the appropriate records, reconstruct the timeline, resolve evidence gaps with an auditable explanation, and generate a report grounded in those verified relationships. Every relevant module must connect to the same underlying investigation data, and the UI must make those connections easy to see and manage.